From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yevhen Salitrynskyi <ysalitrynskyi@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 21:22:22 -0400
Subject: feat: session wall, host routes, site search, split pair, folder
 insert
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Wipe an isolated Space's jar without deleting the Space; copy a tab into
another jar; match routes on host not only eTLD+1; keyword search in the
command bar; a split writes a shared extra_data key and a rename covers
both panes; a folder drop can insert between children.

Why: Independent session was silent; staging and prod shared a site rule;
⌘T could not speak engine keywords; a split did not restore as a pair;
folder reorder only appended.
Removable when: upstream Spaces, ATC and the command bar match this.
